        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin PATAD, One-Sided Arch Rose Patio Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Traditional Arched Patio Deadbolt is normally used on patio doors because it has a thumbturn on the inside and no lock cylinder or plate on the outside of the door. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch. The Traditional Arched Rose Patio Deadbolt is a great way to add a classic touch to any home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Arch Patio Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Patio Deadbolt (One Sided)</li>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>1-7/8\" Counterbore. 1\" edge bore for latch.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw bolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Traditional Arched Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness Standard: 1-3/4\" - 2\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>One-Sided Deadbolt:</b> The deadbolt thrown or retracted from interior side only. There is no plate or exposed trim on the exterior.\r\n</p>",
